{{also|Emir}}
==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|en|ameer|amir|emeer}}

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|fro|emir}}, from {{der|en|ar|أَمِير||commander, prince}}. Akin to {{m|en|amir}}, {{m|en|Amir}} and {{m|en|admiral}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|ɪə(ɹ)|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{head|en|noun|plural usually|emirs|rarely|umara}}

# a [[prince]], [[commander]] or other [[leader]] or [[ruler]] in an [[Islamic]] [[nation]].
# a [[descendant]] of the [[prophet]] [[Muhammad]].

